-- New stories: 3 United States stories covering the 2018 federal
-- B2G requirement via Treasury's IPP (format never mandated, unlike
-- Canada), the 2024 US-EU joint declaration on e-invoicing
-- interoperability, and the practical record-keeping requirements
-- that apply even with no B2B mandate. Final country in the current
-- gap-filling batch, identified via the country-by-country
-- story-count audit. Sourced to the official Treasury IPP portal.
