<p><strong>What this means for your team:</strong> don''t mistake "no e-invoicing mandate" for "no compliance requirements at all" — your actual obligation is ensuring whatever electronic invoices you already send or receive remain genuinely accessible and legible for the full 7-year window, not just stored somewhere. This is also a genuinely good moment to build real e-invoicing capability voluntarily, given how many trading partners — across the EU, India, Mexico, Brazil, and elsewhere in this tracker — already require it on their end, even without any US mandate forcing the issue domestically.</p>');
